# Architecture Diagrams

Cross-cutting, system-wide diagrams for <PROJECT_NAME>. Each `## <Stable Name>`
section is a merge target for archived OpenSpec changes. Keep the names stable.

## Module Hierarchy

Dependency direction between the application's top-level modules or packages.
Arrows point from the dependent module to its dependency.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    APP["app - entry point"] --> UI["ui - presentation"]
    APP --> DATA["data - repository implementations"]
    UI --> DOMAIN["domain - entities, interfaces, use cases"]
    DATA --> DOMAIN
    DOMAIN --> CORE["core - shared utilities"]
```

## End-to-End Data Flow

How a typical user action travels from the UI to the backend and back.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant V as View
    participant S as State holder
    participant R as Repository
    participant B as Backend API
    U->>V: action
    V->>S: dispatch intent
    activate S
    S->>R: fetch or update
    activate R
    R->>B: HTTP request
    B-->>R: response
    deactivate R
    R-->>S: result
    S-->>V: new state
    deactivate S
```
